  "instructions": [
    "Heat the oil in a large pan over medium heat.",
    "Add the onion and cook until it is translucent.",
    "Add the garlic and ginger and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the curry powder and cook for 1 minute, stirring constantly.",
    "Add the passion fruit pulp and cook for 2 minutes, stirring occasionally.",
    "Pour in the coconut milk and bring the mixture to a simmer.",
    "Reduce the heat to low and cook for 10 minutes, stirring occasionally.",
    "Season the curry with salt, black pepper, and turmeric.",
    "Serve the curry hot over rice or with naan bread."
